      <h1 style="max-width:680px">Get a rough cost estimate in under two minutes.</h1>
      <p style="font-size:1rem;line-height:1.75;color:var(--gray2);max-width:560px;margin-top:20px">Tell us your space type, square footage, and scope level. We will show you a rough range based on current GTA market rates. This is not a formal quote, it is a starting point so you can plan before reaching out.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
