      <p>The estimate tool gives you a planning range. A site visit gives you a line-item quote you can take to your landlord, investor, or board. Request one today.</p>
      <a href="/contact" class="btn btn-red">Request a Formal Quote <svg class="arrow-icon" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none"><path d="M3 13L13 3M6 3h7v7" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg></a>
    </div>
